{"lines":[{"w":0.10730448404947916,"c":1,"h":0.016169207007673103,"t":"Audioscripts","y":0.060956094152227802,"x":0.08475606236347645},{"t":"Now, compared to the rubber tree, dandelions produce relatively small amounts of rubber,","x":0.088235297595583975,"h":0.0161287369137465,"y":0.1074177746018018,"w":0.6314878845214843,"c":1},{"y":0.12351294592137196,"x":0.088235304920051952,"w":0.62629755655924479,"t":"but unlike rubber trees, they're very adaptable. They'll grow in all sorts of places, and they","h":0.014695591322603119,"c":1},{"t":"don't need rich soil. So at present there are several projects underway investigating the","y":0.13808139551882082,"w":0.60726643880208342,"c":1,"x":0.086505195196708989,"h":0.017441859689102501},{"y":0.15535339410046201,"w":0.36332178751627603,"x":0.088235299937468592,"c":1,"h":0.014704745661720198,"t":"possibility of using dandelions as a source of rubber."},{"c":1,"t":"Another possibility is a desert shrub grown in Mexico and Texas...","y":0.18019594121458116,"w":0.46539789835611978,"x":0.084775099167800932,"h":0.01469559132260323},{"w":0.083108456929524732,"h":0.016222291763551278,"y":0.21499931888281443,"t":"TEST 2","c":1,"x":0.36502016591439401},{"t":"PART 1","y":0.27746676017314242,"x":0.086505191392804423,"w":0.083044980367024748,"h":0.01469559132260323,"c":1},{"x":0.086505190185467595,"h":0.0087209305119231306,"t":"MAN:","y":0.3095930230931816,"w":0.0346020762125651,"c":1},{"y":0.32406966590107644,"x":0.084757807674288088,"t":"WOMAN:","c":1,"w":0.055397879282633455,"h":0.011744389090194374},{"h":0.0087209298445511951,"t":"MAN:","y":0.37209302336260808,"w":0.034602076212565114,"c":1,"x":0.086505190440430244},{"x":0.086505189548456846,"h":0.010174418263205087,"y":0.38808139549643661,"w":0.053633219401041654,"c":1,"t":"WOMAN:"},{"h":0.011627907349230693,"t":"MAN:","x":0.084775087650555137,"w":0.036332178115844715,"c":1,"y":0.43459302292422186},{"t":"WOMAN:","y":0.50000000015431267,"c":1,"x":0.086505189520932432,"w":0.053633219401041668,"h":0.010174418263205087},{"t":"MAN:","y":0.53197674402341422,"h":0.0087209305119230196,"w":0.0346020762125651,"x":0.086505190185467595,"c":1},{"x":0.088235296275477396,"w":0.051903111139933275,"h":0.010174418263205087,"t":"WOMAN:","y":0.54651162790812613,"c":1},{"t":"MAN:","c":1,"y":0.56395348820946067,"x":0.086505190185467595,"w":0.0346020762125651,"h":0.0087209305119231306},{"y":0.61008960264083623,"t":"WOMAN:","w":0.053857339223225914,"c":1,"x":0.086393129609453778,"h":0.012378934215548365},{"c":1,"x":0.084775087379394654,"h":0.010174418263205087,"w":0.036332178115844715,"t":"MAN:","y":0.62645348850368365},{"c":1,"x":0.086505189518048933,"y":0.67441860480492843,"h":0.010174418263205087,"w":0.053633219401041668,"t":"WOMAN:"},{"t":"MAN:","x":0.084775085741028725,"h":0.010174418263205087,"c":1,"y":0.72238372107551951,"w":0.036332181294759111},{"w":0.47934590657552084,"h":0.017157505908322657,"x":0.17123557939588246,"t":"Hello, Steynford College external course registration, can I help you?","y":0.30521112432003528,"c":1},{"y":0.32260321914045131,"t":"Yeah, I'm ringing to find out about one-day classes next year. I got a leaflet","h":0.01469559132260323,"c":1,"w":0.52422144571940099,"x":0.16782007289918321},{"t":"about them in the post but I lost it, and I understand some of the classes are","y":0.33656269212278755,"w":0.53472478230794274,"h":0.017153589770541933,"x":0.16775075465128167,"c":1},{"c":1,"h":0.01614195955141684,"x":0.16782006932758037,"t":"filling up fast, so I might need to book quite soon if I want to go ahead.","y":0.35304408687286071,"w":0.5},{"x":0.1695054007599891,"y":0.36915474878805599,"w":0.411876475016276,"t":"Sure. Can you remember which one you were considering?","c":1,"h":0.016019562226729844},{"w":0.48442906697591148,"h":0.014534884186538477,"c":1,"t":"There were a few actually. I remember there was one on how to make","y":0.38517441836780963,"x":0.17128027615641184},{"h":0.015988371937820434,"w":0.53633219401041665,"c":1,"t":"Vietnamese food that sounded good. I think that was on the 13th of January.","y":0.40116279077183004,"x":0.16955016589152233},{"w":0.17647059122721351,"t":"It cost about 60 pounds.","y":0.41707487757832218,"x":0.16782006772593719,"h":0.016095171448565315,"c":1},{"x":0.16782007096361193,"h":0.016125685689831304,"c":1,"y":0.43313953495870128,"w":0.54671279907226555,"t":"Yes, you're right about the date, but it's 59 pounds actually. It's a very popular"},{"t":"class, and among other things the teacher explains how Vietnamese food","y":0.44745841013242871,"h":0.017020962970752285,"c":1,"w":0.50884877522786454,"x":0.17118409768328571},{"c":1,"w":0.50519032796223962,"t":"includes lots of different herbs. I'm afraid that all the places are taken at","x":0.16782006083882128,"y":0.46501049706553688,"h":0.01469559132260323},{"h":0.017515404062558138,"c":1,"x":0.17114306779388846,"w":0.39646550496419275,"t":"present, but I can put you on the waiting list if you want?","y":0.47950316671596005},{"y":0.49709302333081973,"w":0.53633219401041665,"t":"No, that's OK. I'm quite interested in the bread making class. That's in March","h":0.015988371937820545,"x":0.16955016588406505,"c":1},{"h":0.016123650873182904,"y":0.51294611646442889,"c":1,"w":0.13148788452148438,"x":0.16782007162045734,"t":"sometime, isn't it?"},{"t":"Yeah, the 20th of March. Would you like to register for that?","y":0.5273636059439355,"x":0.16948322967245577,"w":0.42054690043131515,"c":1,"h":0.017561024264742042},{"c":1,"y":0.54505813929592073,"x":0.16782006949237011,"w":0.20588235219319662,"t":"I'm not sure. How much is it?","h":0.014534884186538477},{"t":"The actual cost is £48 but then there's an extra charge as well as that for the","x":0.17128027232190049,"y":0.55948215520893019,"w":0.52941177368164061,"h":0.01469559132260323,"c":1},{"x":0.16771506044580889,"h":0.019940842107261658,"y":0.57418118979655386,"w":0.51403193155924487,"c":1,"t":"ingredients - I'm not sure how much that is, no more than twenty pounds"},{"h":0.01308139510051276,"y":0.59302325591389093,"c":1,"t":"I think.","x":0.16782006968322385,"w":0.05017300923665366},{"h":0.016128736913746389,"w":0.34775085449218751,"x":0.16955017821861579,"c":1,"t":"So what sorts of things do they make in the class?","y":0.6074177746279632},{"y":0.62351294623685161,"h":0.016095171448565426,"w":0.5432526143391927,"t":"Oh, various types of bread; I think they make white bread and then they make","x":0.16955016335996589,"c":1},{"w":0.55556874593098959,"h":0.020980557334264516,"c":1,"t":"sourdough, that seems to be very fashionable at present, and they learn how to","x":0.1694450852624442,"y":0.63750481016424498},{"x":0.16782006876124483,"w":0.31141868591308597,"h":0.016158234080373979,"y":0.65535339374222668,"t":"make pizza, which is apparently really good.","c":1},{"y":0.66880995566436741,"x":0.16946601220375479,"w":0.54687662760416667,"t":"Well I'd definitely be interested in that, but there were also a few other classes","h":0.019322971266579003,"c":1},{"t":"that sounded interesting. I think there was one on face massage? I'd love to","y":0.6874999997641551,"x":0.16955016272194143,"w":0.52768168131510418,"h":0.014534884186538477,"c":1},{"c":1,"y":0.70348837220628424,"w":0.14878892262776697,"t":"learn how to do that.","x":0.16782007143409808,"h":0.013096652554831723},{"w":0.50877415974934892,"h":0.018768215780077924,"c":1,"t":"Yeah, that's on the 23rd of February and it costs just £35 for the day. The","y":0.71761078407766921,"x":0.16948965809069411},{"x":0.16774608980578629,"y":0.73256562651209745,"c":1,"h":0.019364894228935947,"w":0.52782379150390624,"t":"teacher's great, the type of massage done is a traditional technique used in"},{"x":0.16782006840911304,"w":0.55363321940104171,"h":0.014534884186538477,"t":"India and she actually did her training there. The massage is meant to relax you","c":1,"y":0.75145348813673896},{"w":0.55203262329101555,"t":"and get rid of lines and wrinkles. You practise it on yourself so you have to take","c":1,"x":0.16948758424955221,"y":0.76540707861542623,"h":0.019403848721482153},{"h":0.016911160286862681,"c":1,"t":"a mirror to the class, so you can see what you're doing.","w":0.38594207763671873,"x":0.1712071584029535,"y":0.78181249251809171},{"w":0.05371692657470703,"t":"WOMAN:","c":1,"y":0.80073456683967736,"x":0.086463335933944785,"h":0.011902959301723692},{"x":0.086455439513671711,"y":0.83849895605081148,"h":0.011955576229963127,"w":0.053732719421386715,"c":1,"t":"WOMAN:"},{"t":"MAN:","y":0.85454970003332309,"c":1,"h":0.011830832425992366,"x":0.08645715202602243,"w":0.034698152542114252},{"t":"And I think there was a class in candle making?","y":0.83575581402568833,"h":0.015988371937820545,"c":1,"w":0.32871971130371092,"x":0.16955017888592627},{"w":0.54508677164713537,"c":1,"h":0.017508814433306763,"y":0.85143678669007916,"x":0.16949689367316087,"t":"Yes that's sometime in April, I think. Let me check... yes, it's on the 6th. It was"},{"y":0.86773255821364526,"c":1,"h":0.016102291638405708,"t":"on the 23rd of January but they had to change the date. It's just £52. That's a","w":0.53806228637695308,"x":0.16955017161524352},{"x":0.16955017796719629,"w":0.55536331176757814,"c":1,"h":0.015988371937820545,"t":"popular course too. I think one reason why people like it is because the candles","y":0.88372093030668375},{"h":0.016117548425352735,"t":"are all made out of natural products. It's filling up fast but there's still a few","x":0.16955017101224465,"y":0.89958012591196668,"w":0.52249135335286456,"c":1},{"y":0.91518813365569329,"w":0.07984010696411134,"t":"places left.","x":0.16942250751871074,"c":1,"h":0.015553964944549747},{"w":0.032871971130371103,"t":"102","y":0.95930232583427699,"x":0.086505191100039361,"h":0.014534882851794939,"c":1},{"x":0.75086505241599955,"h":0.01308139510051276,"c":1,"t":"Q40","w":0.032871971130371103,"y":0.13953488380421308},{"y":0.40261627913942388,"c":1,"x":0.75086505162686412,"t":"Q1","w":0.024221453666687043,"h":0.013081395100512871},{"y":0.56104651169260822,"h":0.013081395100512871,"t":"Q2","w":0.025951557159423766,"x":0.75086505178360996,"c":1},{"c":1,"t":"Q3","y":0.65552325587865479,"x":0.75086505163472816,"w":0.024221453666687043,"h":0.013081395100512871},{"t":"Q4","x":0.75086505178360996,"c":1,"h":0.013081395100512871,"y":0.75145348844594217,"w":0.025951557159423766},{"x":0.75086505163351835,"y":0.78343023263198874,"w":0.024221453666686932,"h":0.01308139510051276,"c":1,"t":"Q5"},{"w":0.024221453666686932,"h":0.01308139510051276,"c":1,"x":0.75086505163351835,"y":0.85319767449245387,"t":"Q6"},{"c":1,"t":"Q7","y":0.9011627907715235,"x":0.75086505178360996,"w":0.025951557159423766,"h":0.013081395100512871}],"w":2400,"h":2857}